{"name": "Aptamirror", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.poster.avif?t=1780879860\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.webm?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/3e0f2ba48948809ddc46c5952f9b65ec.mp4?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aptamirror is a meditative puzzle game where you fold RNA strands to match target structures. Manipulate nucleotides with precision, watch the ghost target illuminate as you get closer to the solution, and experience the quiet satisfaction of a perfect fold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.poster.avif?t=1780879860\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.webm?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/87aa32d78b5972309e41782c58c2c68d.mp4?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab, Mutate, Cleave, Ligate. Four tools. Dozens of combinations. Early puzzles teach each mechanic in isolation. Later puzzles demand fluent mastery \u2014 when to cut a strand, when to mutate a base, when to join two halves into one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.poster.avif?t=1780879860\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.webm?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/fb91a35c09e13bcacec4bf0df0191cf2.mp4?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aptamirror doesn't punish you. Every puzzle waits as long as you need. Experiment freely. Reset any time. The only pressure is the one you put on yourself \u2014 chasing a cleaner solution, fewer moves, a perfect three-star fold.\u00a0No microtransactions. Earn stars to unlock backbone and cursor colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed by a PhD Biochemist. Rooted in real science. But you don't need to know a thing about RNA to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.poster.avif?t=1780879860\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.webm?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/extras/a5a16cbba78d6d4e65ec80e37a9c55a3.mp4?t=1780879860\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 levels. 10 chapters. Journey from folding your first hairpin to multi-strand gauntlets that fold your brain. Master every level to achieve the prismatic endgame.  </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Aptamirror is a meditative physics-based puzzle game inspired by molecular biology. Manipulate RNA strands by grabbing, mutating, cleaving, and ligating to match increasingly complex target structures. Challenge yourself with 50 handcrafted puzzles designed by a PhD Biochemist. Think. Fold. Repeat.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589160/a72dad961cb4377c799e85c17b3539711c5f1dc7/header.jpg?t=1780879860", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Science", "Physics", "Difficult", "Strategy"], "developers": "Stellar Genesis Games", "publishers": "Stellar Genesis Games", "release_date": "Nov 2, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4589160", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/zvYUTmCBfSI", "first_seen": 1779573600.0, "review_rank": 571}